cff-version: 1.2.0
title: my-academic-skills
authors:
  - family-names: Han
    given-names: Y.
    alias: SPYfighting
message: >-
  If you use this skill, please cite it and, more importantly, cite the
  Anthropic release it adapts and every scientific method your campaign used.
type: software
abstract: >-
  A collection of agent skills for research work. Its first skill,
  binder-design-campaign, is a gated human-in-the-loop protocol for
  computational protein campaigns: de novo miniprotein binder design, structure
  and complex prediction, and protein engineering. Adapted from Anthropic's
  publicly released autonomous binder design protocol prompt, with the autonomy
  clause inverted into seven human review gates and the internal orchestration
  replaced by a portable compute backend contract.
license: MIT
